      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The history (24 h by default) is synthetic and deterministic, generated by `hack/quickstart/demogen`; the live workloads continue it at the right edge.\n\nIncidents, relative to when the demo started:\n\n| When | Service | What |\n|---|---|---|\n| about 7.5 h to 6.5 h ago | payment-service | provider (acme-pay) slowdown: latency x9, 5xx up to 14%. order-service `POST /orders` and `/cancel` suffer through their payment call. |\n| about 3h40 to 3h10 ago | order-service | bad deploy: database connections exhausted, 5xx up to 18% on every route, latency x3 on database calls |\n| about 1 h to 50 min ago | payment-service | short acme-pay blip |\n\nOpen **Logs** and **Traces** from the *Querdian demo* menu to follow an incident from metrics to logs to traces."
